WEBVTT

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:05.690
<i>While visiting Caislean Merlin,
 the home of the Knights-sorcerers,</i>

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:10.340
<i>Seth was involved in a battle 
against the enigmatic Spectre Nemesis.</i>

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.570
<i>After losing control and ending up hurt,</i>

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:18.020
<i>he began training with Myr, 
a pixie of the forest,</i>

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:19.990
<i>to learn how to control his own power.</i>

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:25.000
<i>By sensing Fantasia and connecting
 with the world, Seth gained the ability</i>

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.490
<i>to control his power 
and use creation magic.</i>

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:31.200
<i>Meanwhile, in the capital,</i>

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.260
<i>the appearance of Spectre Nemesis
 has been suppressed,</i>

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:38.150
<i>and peace has reigned
 for the first time in a long while.</i>

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:43.610
<i>However, a conspiracy is still 
afoot in the capital,</i>

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:47.830
<i>unbeknownst to the people, 
but steadily progressing.</i>

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:52.830
<i>The moment of destiny is at hand.</i>

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:30.000
<b>The Truth Is Like a Curse 
-Ocoho-</b>

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:28.650
<i>"The Truth Is Like a Curse."</i>

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:43.530
Is there a festival?

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:47.260
The Knights-sorcerers' ordination ceremony
 is about to begin.

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:49.270
It's going to be lively around here.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:51.460
Really? Yay!

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:54.150
How many years has it been?

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:56.670
With all these people coming in,

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:59.400
this is our chance to make a fortune!

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:02.900
It's the great Merlin's blessing!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:13.500
Now, you have to hold still, Draccoon.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.940
There you go!

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:19.150
It's already been a whole week.

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:20.710
Are you talking about Seth?

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:21.750
Yeah.

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:26.010
You think he's actually doing any training?

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:27.890
Don't worry about him.

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:32.250
Once Seth says he's going to do something,
 he gives it his all.

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:34.020
I see.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:37.810
I couldn't say 
how well it's going, though.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:39.650
I see.

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:41.440
You can say that again!

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:44.910
When he gets hyped up about something, 
it only leads to trouble!

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:48.210
Melie, your training is over, right?

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:50.070
So let's just—

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:52.520
I'm staying until the festival.

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:53.420
Huh?!

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:55.610
If you want to go home, go by yourself.

00:03:55.610 --> 00:04:00.550
You can't expect a little kid like me 
to make that journey alone!

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:03.130
Why did you even come here, then?

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:06.910
That's right. 
I never asked you to come with me.

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:10.180
I came because I was worried 
about you two!

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:13.610
You've been acting 
as if nothing even happened!

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:15.870
You worry too much, Doc.

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:17.440
Oh, for crying out loud!

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:21.570
If I'd known this place was so dangerous, 
I wouldn't have come at all!

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:26.540
But the Spectre Nemesis 
haven't been appearing anymore.

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:29.110
Hmph! We haven't found 
whoever's behind it all yet.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.600
They must still be out there somewhere.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:35.460
What the heck are those guys 
at the castle doing?!

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:38.140
Since they won't show their faces,

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:40.340
they're clearly part 
of some organization.

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:43.250
You mean there are enemies on the inside?

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.340
So it's a coup d'état...

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:50.100
Sorry!

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.290
I'm leaving tomorrow!

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:53.750
I've had it with this place!

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:55.230
Stop!

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.530
Cut it out!

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:57.790
Hey, stop!

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.130
Lord Brangoire...

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:05.740
Again?

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:10.620
How many times is that now?

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.930
I am not your servant!

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:15.620
Huh?

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:20.450
Why do I have to brush 
your stupid overstuffed plushie?

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:22.310
Come over here! 
I'll take good care of you!

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:23.770
Oh, crap!

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:27.260
She's been so quiet for so long... 
but she's back!

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:31.870
Ah! There's the Melie I love!

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:35.750
Come on! Time for some drills!

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:37.470
Here I go!

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:50.580
You're not bad.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.120
Neither are you.

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:54.870
I'll beat you up some more tomorrow.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:58.120
Tomorrow? Can't wait!

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:01.930
What the heck is with you two?

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.380
All right, let's go.

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.540
Hey! Melie!

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:08.010
See you tomorrow.

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:11.490
Hey.

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:15.390
Ocoho, got a minute?

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:19.900
Hey! Let me go!

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:23.020
Nope. We'll be seen.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:25.900
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:28.660
There's some nasty stuff going on.

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:29.410
Huh?

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:34.990
Wait, did you...

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:36.650
Keep struggling.

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:39.820
If he finds out I'm onto him, 
we'll be in trouble.

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:45.300
Ouch! No, stop! Help me!

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:48.300
Looks like he's keeping an eye
 on the door.

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:50.820
So he's after Ocoho.

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:52.800
You knew?

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:56.310
He's been watching us all day.

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:59.060
You think he's with the group 
behind the conspiracy?

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.270
Probably.

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:04.320
But... there's no need for us 
to poke our noses into trouble, is there?

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:05.440
Shh!

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:10.460
Someone's coming out. Is it Ocoho?

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:36.410
Just leave me behind! 
I can't keep up with this pace!

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:40.230
Don't be stupid! 
They might be after us, too!

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:43.970
Don't leave me, please!

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:46.340
Cut it out! You're gonna—

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:50.570
Well, if it isn't my beloved!

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:54.620
Imagine meeting out here! 
It must be fate!

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.370
Destiny! Sophistry! 
Dentistry! Artistry!

00:07:56.370 --> 00:08:00.460
Could it be that you came here 
just to see me?

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:01.450
What?

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:03.170
Oh! It's Lord de Gulis!

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:04.580
Yes, hello. Hello, hello.

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:04.580
The Gold Knight!

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:09.020
So, I hear you only recently came to the capital,

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:11.130
and you hardly know
 your left from your right.

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:14.800
Well, why don't I show you around 
every nook and cranny...

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:17.910
I'm in a hurry! Get out my way!

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:18.370
My cheek... My cheek...

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:21.990
Oh, the pain! 
But my beloved's hand touched my cheek!

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:25.900
Is this love? 
Oh, what bliss! But it hurts!

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.810
Oh, Lord de Gulis...

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:30.020
He's such a fun guy.

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:32.400
Too many people here.

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:35.320
Doc, you and Boobrie go on ahead.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:37.220
You're small, so you can get through.

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:39.410
What?! No way!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:40.670
Boobrie.

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.730
Now, listen to me.

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:46.430
If you can track them down...

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:48.790
I'll give you the beating 
of a lifetime.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:57.150
Boobrie! You're dropping!

00:08:57.150 --> 00:08:59.050
Pull up! Pull up!

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:03.060
My head's gonna get knocked right off!

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:15.320
You!

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:18.320
You will regret what you've done!

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:24.900
Ow, ow, ow...

00:09:24.900 --> 00:09:26.590
Who are you?

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:29.210
Are you trying to get in my way?

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:31.940
No, not at all!

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:36.970
S-Stop that! I have no time 
for you weaklings!

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:40.220
Traitor!

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:44.220
I'm captured?!

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:47.980
Bingo.

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:52.260
Brangoire, were you trying 
to kill Ocoho?

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:54.110
You don't know how mistaken you are!

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:56.360
What are you talking about?

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:59.120
You fool! Open your eyes!

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:03.240
She's the one behind
 all the Spectre appearances!

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:08.250
Seth?

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:19.010
<b>[The Mysteriously Engraved Stones] 
These stones were found where Spectre Nemesis appeared. 
It is said that they were in Ocoho's possession...</b>

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:25.530
Seth! Where did you come from?!

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:29.270
This is the f-first time 
I've ever been happy to see you!

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:31.820
This isn't the time to chat!

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:32.740
Get up!

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:35.820
<i>What the heck is going on?</i>

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.110
<i>She's serious!</i>

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:47.660
Ocoho!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:49.580
What's wrong with you?!

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:56.040
Sh-She really wants to kill us!

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:58.370
L-Let me in! Hurry! Hurry!

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:00.180
Let me out of here at once!

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:19.340
That's enough!

00:11:19.930 --> 00:11:22.110
Ocoho, stop it!

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:24.410
What's turned you into this?

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:30.830
<i>Those eyes... I've seen them before.</i>

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:33.540
Enough! If you won't surrender,
 then I'll...

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:36.210
Wait! We have to hear her out first!

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:41.220
Move, boy! 
She just tried to make a Nemesis appear!

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:49.590
I'd finally caught her red-handed, 
and you ruined it!

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:54.480
In the name of the great Merlin, 
I won't let you escape!

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:59.150
Ocoho was... calling a Nemesis?

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:05.980
So Ocoho wasn't who she claimed to be?
 Surely not...

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:09.490
Melie! We have to catch her 
before Brangoire does!

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:10.570
Huh?

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:13.000
She wasn't her normal self!

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:16.750
Are you saying she's being controlled?

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.240
I don't know.

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:19.380
What?!

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:22.450
It doesn't matter! 
We have to get to her first!

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:23.940
Leave it to me!

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:27.140
And how do you plan 
to get ahead of him?

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:28.810
Stop being dumb and get on!

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.680
I know a shortcut!

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.560
Seth!

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:39.590
Hey... Did you forget about me?

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:47.200
All right, let's call it day.

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:50.580
What is it, boss?

00:12:50.890 --> 00:12:54.680
Look there, on the road to the castle.

00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:55.830
It looks like...

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:00.490
D-Dullahan!

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:02.860
Its head isn't attached 
to its shoulders!

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:05.590
Dullahan is on my land?!

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:06.830
We have to run!

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:07.790
Wait...

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:09.730
It's a harbinger of vengeance!

00:13:09.730 --> 00:13:11.690
A Spectre is coming!

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:12.460
Wait!

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:16.170
This happened because we accepted 
the Merchant Barons' offer!

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:20.610
The great Merlin must have sent 
that thing to punish us!

00:13:33.050 --> 00:13:35.510
<i>Yes. It's Caillte's forest.</i>

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:48.690
Ocoho! What are you doing?

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:51.940
Why is this happening to you?!

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:56.150
Damn it. Stop fighting me!

00:13:56.150 --> 00:13:58.140
Just calm down!

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:02.370
Oh. That was easier than I thought.

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:06.650
Well done! Don't let her go!

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:09.260
You traitor!

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:12.660
I have the proof now! 
I won't hear your excuses!

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:16.330
Huh? Lord Brangoire?

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:18.370
And... Melie?

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:23.700
Seth? Why do you have me by the neck?

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:25.170
What's going on?

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:28.970
Wait... You guys are scaring me!

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:32.300
What are you trying to do? Tell me!

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:38.600
I'm the traitor?

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:42.730
I don't know what you're talking about! 
I had nothing to do with it!

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.450
Liar!

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:48.110
You just tried to make
 a Spectre Nemesis appear!

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:51.190
What are you saying?! 
I'd never do that!

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:52.890
What's going on?

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:54.380
No idea.

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:57.610
But I don't think Ocoho's lying.

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:01.080
I won't be fooled!

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.770
I've been observing her all this time!

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:07.120
So you've suspected her all along?

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:10.140
She seemed to be hiding 
some kind of secret.

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:14.010
All she ever did was ignore my orders 
and act on her own.

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:18.290
And when the queen started talking 
about Spectre Nemesis,

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:20.560
her face tensed up.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.850
Now, put out your arms.

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:25.190
I'm not lying!

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.700
She's telling you that you're wrong.

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:29.400
We should hear her out.

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:32.320
You both saw her! Why do you deny it?

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:36.180
If you're calling her suspicious, 
I've gotta say you were being suspicous, too.

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:37.450
What?!

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:39.280
When I came back from the forest today,

00:15:39.280 --> 00:15:43.050
I saw you following Ocoho 
and keeping a close eye on her,

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:44.420
so I watched you.

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:46.980
I just had a feeling.

00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:51.270
Huh? If you were back, 
you should've told us sooner!

00:15:51.270 --> 00:15:53.050
I'm sorry, okay?

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:57.200
I did have a stone, didn't I?

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:59.540
I believe what you guys say.

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:01.310
O-Okay...

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:05.410
But still... I don't know anything.

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:09.820
This mark...

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:15.320
When anyone presses on it, 
I end up doing whatever they say.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:19.110
And I lose my memories 
of what happens when I do.

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:22.740
So that's your curse?

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:24.080
Yes.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:25.750
What are you saying?

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:30.090
She's saying someone used her. Damn it!

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:38.470
Take your own life.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:40.850
Don't!

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:42.100
Stop.

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:49.500
What did I just...

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:51.610
Now I get it.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:55.990
Ocoho, does anyone else know 
about that mark?

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:57.530
No.

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.400
That's the law in this nation.

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:03.470
We must keep our own curses secret.

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:09.110
So whoever knows about that mark 
is the one behind all these incidents.

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:12.800
See? Ocoho wasn't behind it after all!

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:18.010
Ocoho, you must return to the castle

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:22.810
and continue to live as normal 
until we find out who's behind this.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.560
You're setting me free?

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:28.370
It's the only way. 
We don't want the enemy to suspect anything.

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:30.570
So you're letting her 
go free on purpose?

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:33.070
I will catch the one behind all this.

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:36.620
I won't let anyone else 
find out about your curse.

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:37.910
Don't worry.

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:41.020
However...

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:45.500
I cannot allow someone who can be
 so easily manipulated by enemies

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:48.080
become a Knight-sorcerer.

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:51.090
I will oppose your ordination.

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:01.050
I'm sorry.

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:03.970
If there's anything we can do...

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.980
Yeah, like giving him 
a good kick in the ass!

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:09.900
Ocoho, what should we do?

00:18:12.390 --> 00:18:13.900
I have to see Mordred.

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:17.860
He's always saved me.

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:20.620
There's something I need to find out.

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:23.830
Huh? Where's this coming from now?

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.500
Come to think of it...

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:29.530
I saw you with him 
in the stables a while back.

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:33.910
I, uh, thought he was kissing you.

00:18:35.310 --> 00:18:40.260
But then your eyes went hollow, 
just the way they were earlier.

00:18:45.650 --> 00:18:49.610
How could you leave a kid like me 
in a place like that?!

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:51.500
I'm sorry, Doc.

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:56.900
I caused a lot of trouble 
for you guys, huh?

00:18:56.900 --> 00:19:00.130
Don't worry about it. 
It's always like this for us.

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:02.790
Give me a break already.

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:07.290
There's a lot of Fantasia 
packed into this stone.

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:12.290
So you were using that 
to activate the projection magic?

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.530
It's weird, though...

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:17.870
This Fantasia feels just like mine.

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:18.800
Huh?

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:20.730
Diabal...

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:22.180
Who is that?

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:24.970
The guy I met beneath the castle.

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:28.560
I'm sure he knows something!

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:32.190
But we can't get past the guards, can we?

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:34.260
No, wait.

00:19:34.260 --> 00:19:37.940
It might be easy to get in 
on the day of the ordination ceremony.

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:42.390
With all the events going on, 
castle security is lighter.

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:43.950
That's good to hear.

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:48.450
I used to sneak into the castle
 that way when I was little.

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:50.580
With my best friends...

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:54.340
I have to see Mordred.

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:57.090
Hey, Ocoho...

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:02.220
If anyone tries to touch the mark 
on your neck, knock them out.

00:20:02.710 --> 00:20:04.580
No matter what anyone says,

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:08.650
your curse doesn't decide your fate.

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:11.010
Don't let anyone interfere with that.

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:15.230
If you need help, 
we'll be right beside you.

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:17.730
Okay.

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:19.310
Thanks.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:33.560
<i>Dragunov and Liselotte had succeeded 
in sneaking into Cyfandir,</i>

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:37.750
<i>but now, having received new secret orders 
from General Torque,</i>

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:40.070
<i>they are on their way 
to a certain location.</i>

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:44.000
New orders after we sneak 
into the target location?

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:46.140
What could this be about?

00:20:46.690 --> 00:20:50.350
And they sure picked 
a weird place for us to go.

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:56.750
They're either being very careful 
or feeling very guilty.

00:20:57.180 --> 00:21:00.650
Regardless, it's a direct order 
from General Torque.

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:02.900
Hey, Dragunov...

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:07.350
When General Torque said 
you were to become a Thaumaturge,

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:10.660
you didn't seem very enthusiastic.

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:13.220
That's not true at all.

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:15.670
We all express joy in different ways.

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:19.390
But when you were ordered 
to pursue the horned sorcerer,

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:21.860
you didn't try to hide your delight.

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:26.990
Dragunov, if you try to act 
on your own judgment,

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:29.930
I'll have no choice but to punish you.

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:35.560
Fine. I'll confess.

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:38.460
But keep this between the two of us, okay?

00:21:40.180 --> 00:21:42.940
The reason I looked so happy...

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:46.960
was that I saw it as a chance 
to get close to a certain someone,

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:48.320
Captain Liselotte.

00:21:49.430 --> 00:21:50.540
Hey...

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:01.050
Seems that we've arrived.

00:22:10.460 --> 00:22:13.840
Ah, we're so glad you're here.

00:22:13.840 --> 00:22:16.600
Sorry this location 
is so out of the way.

00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:22.110
Captain Liselotte and Captain Dragunov 
of the Thaumaturges, correct?

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:29.990
To Be Continued

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:20.700
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:00.650 --> 00:24:04.010
<i>Ocoho interrogates her close friend Mordred.</i>

00:24:04.010 --> 00:24:06.410
<i>Why did he try to use her?</i>

00:24:06.410 --> 00:24:10.010
<i>Who are the "Faithful of the Hermit," 
scheming in the nation's underbelly?</i>

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:12.060
<i>Who can she trust?</i>

00:24:12.060 --> 00:24:13.900
<i>What is the knights' true ambition?</i>

00:24:13.900 --> 00:24:16.110
<i>Then, on the day of the ordination ceremony,</i>

00:24:16.110 --> 00:24:20.860
<i>Ocoho gives the queen some advice
 in hopes of bringing the truth to light.</i>

00:24:20.700 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>Your Decision 
-Knighthood-</b>

00:24:20.860 --> 00:24:23.870
<i>Next time on <i>Radiant</i>, "Your Decision."</i>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>Darn it, he's always...!</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>End</b>
